Description: Say that a film has no sound when it has a picture and no audio track: on the picture for six seconds, in place of a missing subtitle, and in the Media menu beside the volume controls, with the sentence of the stereo layer in ten languages. The volume controls stay usable.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 579)
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code

